+  ;; Live ledger pin, /tmp/futon3c-invoke-jobs.edn, job
+  ;; invoke-1787750995295-1507-0f434f39 (captured 2026-09-02): these values are
+  ;; verbatim -- state "failed", created-at 2026-08-26T13:29:55.295079374Z,
