    :acceptance "default-gamma-edn-path (and any sibling path heuristics in the namespace) resolve correctly from a renamed worktree -- test proves it by resolving under a simulated foreign cwd; the D8-review repro (sibling worktree, no env var) goes green; gates clean."}
