/home/joe/code/futon3c/test/fixtures/apm/f30-guide-proof-text-memory.edn:1:{:evidence/body {:name "contract-2-endgame-geometric-ratio-2-pow-1-minus-alpha-compiled-plus-four-failure-classes", :hook "Contract 2 endgame of apm_a01J06_summable_of_linear_count: shell totals (C*2^(k+1))*(2^k)^(-α) to a geometric series with ratio 2^(1-α) for α > 1 — compiled helpers and one-line Summable.of_nonneg_of_le closing, plus the four failure classes from attempt 2: rw fails between HPow x ^ y and Real.rpow forms, Summable.of_nonneg_of_le argument order (g minorant, f majorant), haveI Fintype for a Set ℕ subtype needs classical + Finite.to_subtype first, Nat.pow_le_pow_right needs the (2:ℕ) > 0 base explicitly; never introduce q = 2^(-α)", :kind :fact, :body "RESIDUAL VOCABULARY (a01J06, student-attempt-1 + attempt-2 failure accounts): the Contract-2\nendgame of `apm_a01J06_summable_of_linear_count` — converting the shell totals\n`(C*2^(k+1)) * (2^k)^(-α)` into a summable geometric series with ratio `2^(1-α)` for `α > 1`.\nAttempt 1 died here (8 cast/tactic errors); attempt 2 closed it after ~10 compile-fix cycles and\nrecorded four recurring failure classes. This memory gives the compiled endgame AND those four\nclasses, so the next reader pays neither.\n\nTHE FOUR FAILURE CLASSES (attempt 2, verbatim intent) AND WHAT COMPILES:\n\n(1) `rw` with `Real.rpow` lemmas fails when the goal shows HPow notation `x ^ y` and the lemma\n    is stated in `Real.rpow` form (or vice versa) — a syntactic mismatch even when the two are\n    rfl. FIX: pick ONE notation for the whole endgame. Either (a) convert everything to `^` and\n    prove the two exponent identities with `Real.rpow_natCast`, `Real.rpow_mul`, `Real.rpow_add`\n    ending in `congr 1; ring`; or (b) stay in `Real.rpow` and switch with `Real.rpow_eq_pow`\n    before `Real.rpow_def_of_pos`. Do not mix.\n\n(2) `Summable.of_nonneg_of_le` argument order: `(hg : ∀ b, 0 ≤ g b) (hgf : ∀ b, g b ≤ f b)\n    (hf : Summable f) : Summable g` — g is the MINORANT you want, f the summable majorant. With\n    named args: `Summable.of_nonneg_of_le (g := shellTotals) (f := majorant) hnonneg hle hmajor`,\n    or dot-form `hmajor.of_nonneg_of_le hnonneg hle`.\n\n(3) `haveI : Fintype ↑s` for a `Set ℕ` subtype does not fire until `classical` AND a `Finite`\n    instance are in scope, in that order:\n        classical\n        haveI : Finite ↑s := (hfin k).to_subtype\n        haveI : Fintype ↑s := Fintype.ofFinite _\n    then `rw [tsum_fintype]`, `Finset.sum_const`, `Finset.card_univ`, `← Nat.card_eq_fintype_card`,\n    `Nat.card_coe_set_eq`. (`Finset.sum_le_card_nsmul` exists but its `•` output shape did not\n    match the ℝ-multiplication goal even after push_cast; `Finset.sum_const` + the cast chain did.)\n\n(4) Shell-index uniqueness via `Nat.pow_le_pow_right` needs the base positivity passed\n    explicitly: `Nat.pow_le_pow_right (by norm_num : (2:ℕ) > 0) h`, then `exact_mod_cast` /\n    `push_cast at hle; linarith`. Term-mode alternative for `1 + ‖ω n‖ < 2^(k+1) → ‖ω n‖ ≤ 2^(k+1)`\n    that is immune to `set`-abstraction confusing `linarith`:\n    `(le_add_of_nonneg_left zero_le_one).trans hn.2.le`.\n\nCOMPILED ENDGAME, form (b) — three helpers + a one-line closing (verified: the attempt-1 file with\nthese edits compiles with 0 sorries; `lake env lean`, apm-lean f7de6887, 2026-08-24). Works for\nshells written with either `(2:ℝ)^k` or `((2:ℕ)^k : ℝ)`:\n\n/-- `2^(1-α) < 1` exactly when `α > 1`; one Mathlib lemma, no `rpow_def_of_pos` rewrite. -/\nlemma apm_a01J06_rpow_two_one_sub_lt_one {α : ℝ} (hα : 1 < α) : Real.rpow 2 (1 - α) < 1 :=\n  Real.rpow_lt_one_of_one_lt_of_neg (by norm_num) (sub_neg.mpr hα)\n\n/-- The shell majorant `(C·2^(k+1))·(2^k)^(-α)` is the geometric term `(2C)·(2^(1-α))^k`. -/\nlemma apm_a01J06_shell_majorant_eq_geometric (C α : ℝ) (k : ℕ) :\n    (C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (k + 1)) * Real.rpow ((2 : ℝ) ^ k) (-α) =\n      (2 * C) * (Real.rpow 2 (1 - α)) ^ k := by\n  have hpow : (2 : ℝ) ^ k = Real.exp ((k : ℝ) * Real.log 2) := by\n    rw [Real.exp_nat_mul, Real.exp_log (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2)]\n  rw [pow_succ, Real.rpow_eq_pow, Real.rpow_eq_pow,\n    Real.rpow_def_of_pos (pow_pos (by norm_num) k),\n    Real.rpow_def_of_pos (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2), Real.log_pow, ← Real.exp_nat_mul, hpow]\n  calc\n    _ = (2 * C) * (Real.exp ((k : ℝ) * Real.log 2) *\n        Real.exp (-((k : ℝ) * Real.log 2 * α))) := by ring_nf\n    _ = (2 * C) * Real.exp ((k : ℝ) * Real.log 2 + -((k : ℝ) * Real.log 2 * α)) := by\n          rw [Real.exp_add]\n    _ = _ := by congr 2; ring_nf\n\n/-- Same majorant in the `((2:ℕ)^k : ℝ)` cast form; summable for `α > 1`. -/\nlemma apm_a01J06_summable_shell_majorant_natcast (C : ℝ) {α : ℝ} (hα : 1 < α) :\n    Summable (fun k : ℕ ↦ (C * ((2:ℕ)^(k+1) : ℝ)) * Real.rpow ((2:ℕ)^k : ℝ) (-α)) := by\n  have hg : Summable (fun k : ℕ ↦ (Real.rpow 2 (1 - α)) ^ k) :=\n    summable_geometric_of_lt_one (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos (by norm_num) _).le\n      (apm_a01J06_rpow_two_one_sub_lt_one hα)\n  convert hg.mul_left (2 * C) using 1\n  ext k\n  have h1 : ((2:ℕ)^(k+1) : ℝ) = (2:ℝ)^(k+1) := by push_cast; ring\n  have h2 : ((2:ℕ)^k : ℝ) = (2:ℝ)^k := by push_cast; ring\n  rw [h1, h2]\n  exact apm_a01J06_shell_majorant_eq_geometric C α k\n\n-- closing the second `summable_partition` goal, with `htotal : ∀ k, (∑' i : s k, f i) ≤\n-- (C * 2^(k+1)) * Real.rpow (2^k) (-α)` and `hf0 : 0 ≤ f` in scope:\n    exact (apm_a01J06_summable_shell_majorant_natcast C hα).of_nonneg_of_le\n      (fun k ↦ tsum_nonneg fun i ↦ hf0 i) htotal\n\nCOMPILED ENDGAME, form (a) — the Student's own attempt-2 identity block in `^` notation\n(compiles in the closed a01J06 file, blob 0d476182), `q := Real.rpow 2 (1 - α)`:\n\n  have hLHS : ((2 : ℝ) ^ (k : ℕ)) ^ (-α) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (k : ℕ) =\n      2 ^ ((k : ℝ) * (-α) + (k : ℝ)) := by\n    rw [← Real.rpow_natCast 2 k,\n      ← Real.rpow_mul (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2), ← Real.rpow_add hpos2]\n  have hRHS : q ^ k = 2 ^ ((1 - α) * (k : ℝ)) := by\n    rw [← Real.rpow_natCast q k, hq, Real.rpow_mul (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2)]\n    rfl\n  have hkey : ((2 : ℝ) ^ (k : ℕ)) ^ (-α) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (k : ℕ) = q ^ k := by\n    rw [hLHS, hRHS]\n    congr 1\n    ring\n\nWHY THE OLD ROUTE FAILS: introducing `q = 2^(-α)` and converting `(2^k)^(-α)` to `q^k`, then a\nratio `2q`, is where the `rpow_def_of_pos` motive failure and the `(2q)^k` pow-cast mismatch come\nfrom. Keep the ratio as `2^(1-α)` and prove the majorant identity once; the geometric-shell\npattern's `b^(1-α)` ratio is the object to name, not `b^(-α)`.\n"}, :evidence/session-id "apm-role-fdcbd2e960511908cc9f6b66100878962e109c2bf70aa6063a9aa73dc37fd1a0", :evidence/tags [:memory :memory/assert], :evidence/at "2026-08-24T17:27:34.194938667Z", :evidence/type :memory, :evidence/subject {:ref/type :problem, :ref/id "a01J06"}, :evidence/author "f30-guide", :evidence/claim-type :assert, :evidence/id "e-20851bde-ba9a-4883-8b4e-0c2f0f741fe9"}
