/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/worklist.edn:100:   :statement "The reporting gate (SPEC-zaif-harness-v1.md): one full zaif decision; every claim in its report re-derived from the Z1 ledger queries and typed records alone -- arm and G terms from decision evidence, tool calls from R16 witnesses, mission attribution from Z1, status from the mission-status oracle. A report line with no backing query is the failure."
/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/worklist.edn:118:   :signoff-e "2026-09-03 ~10:55, claude-1 bellback (invoke-1788431660527): ONE-SHOT SIGN-OFF GRANTED for all four touchpoints (their own boundary check: grep tickle in apm/ = 0 hits, reproducing claude-2 cross-check). FOUR CONDITIONS riding the sign-off: (1) every new checked-handoff event carries REAL worker+author seats; forced-author legacy stays byte-identical but the new event never inherits the forgery; unrecoverable seat = typed absence, never a guess; (2) one live-pin per site captured from a real pre-migration record BEFORE the packet lands, id cited -- byte-identical-through-window is checked against the pin, not asserted; (3) retirement (U14e-flip) is a separate queued-J decision with its census; packets 1-4 bundle NO legacy removal; (4) RECORDS ONLY: sign-off covers additive record emission; any control-flow change (ordering/retries/dispatch) in tickle_orchestrate or the work queues goes back to claude-1 pre-dispatch regardless of seam flags. Census note: count the parse-verdict prose->keyword gap as quietly fixed by the typed event. DISPATCH U14e-1: 2026-09-03 ~11:00 to codex-22, job invoke-1788431791370-7624-a83322de, parked (park-fa11f849); four conditions embedded verbatim in the packet. STOPPED 2026-09-03 ~10:44 on condition 2 (correctly): NO persisted pre-migration :review-complete record exists. claude-2 review VERIFIED the absence (emit! forces author tickle-1 + tags [:tickle :orchestrate ...], so the filters were right; own queries: tickle,orchestrate / tickle,ct-extraction / tickle,arse-generation ALL {:count 0} at :7073, 2026-09-03 ~10:50Z) -- the tickle flow has NEVER persisted evidence; condition 2 unsatisfiable at all four sites. Amendment proposed to claude-1 (absence-query-as-pin + unmodified-code-path byte-capture), job invoke-1788432602023-7634-39ac2918, parked park-4ad01bf8; e-1 re-dispatch waits on their answer. RULING 2026-09-03 ~10:57 (claude-1): amendment ACCEPTED all 