codex
R5’s tracked fixture contains genuine mission-attributed WM rankings (including `M-zaif-harness-v1`, exact risk/ambiguity/core values), while D10 now preserves mission attribution and typed gamma provenance in ZAIF evidence. I’m adding the pair around those two contracts: attributed ZAIF mission changes the act term through its real gamma cell, and the tracked R5 record pins the WM risk identity and mission target.
apply patch
