/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/runs/build-loop.log-13039-/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/worklist.edn:199:   :statement "83/114 live decisions settled by case order, not arithmetic (SURPRISES.md entry 9, review-confirmed): with :act and :yield both structurally 0.0 they tie at the maximum whenever :retrieve and :ask score <= 0, and choose-arm's case order takes :act; only the 31 :retrieve choices were arithmetic. Same family as ZU-2's unreachable :ask. EXPECTATION CORRECTED by D8a (2026-09-02): D8b retains the zero fallback, so the replay will show tie behaviour ~unchanged; this row's value is pinning that count as the standing gap attributable to :d8/task-belief-actand-source-absent (U11), not confirming a fix. If a majority still tie after U11 lands a real source, that is the design finding."
