hing dark WM episode through the same writer and backend, then recalling it through `p4ng/R15`.\n\nBoth domains now pass the live gate through the same code: one recalled memory each, complete provenance, zero malformed/missing entries, and cross-domain queries return no memories while explicitly counting one excluded edge. The common use-receipt constructor also produced valid pending-outcome receipts for both domains.\n\nBoth domains now pass the live gate through the same code: one recalled memory each, complete provenance, zero malformed/missing entries, and cross-domain queries return no memories while explicitly counting one excluded edge. The common use-receipt constructor also produced valid pending-outcome receipts for both domains.\n\nPhase 1 is functionally closed. I’m running the final source gates and checking that the store, Agency JVM, `zai-5`, and both live recall endpoints remain healthy after the deployment—not just at the instant each test ran.\n\nPhase 1 is functionally closed. I’m running the final source gates and checking that the store, Agency JVM, `zai-5`, and both live recall endpoints remain healthy after the deployment—not just at the instant each test ran.\n\nTOOL DIGEST\n{:kind :function_call, :name \"update_plan\", :call-id \"call_d8uBORMZGlTX99l9AoqYjVov\", :args \"{\\\"plan\\\":[{\\\"step\\\":\\\"Resolve sanctioned live reload and Zai runner creation procedures\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\"},{\\\"step\\\":\\\"Deploy Phase 1 namespaces without JVM restart and verify conjunctive live query\\\",\\\"…\"}\n{:kind :function_call_output, :call-id \"call_d8uBORMZGlTX99l9AoqYjVov\", :output \"Plan updated\"}\n{:kind :custom_tool_call, :name \"exec\", :call-id \"call_JfT8GYxt9IIhJrfk5jZR7TB7\", :args \"const r = await tools.exec_command({\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"Drawbridge|drawbridge|load-file|reload.*namespace|futon1b-server.service|7073|create.*zai|new zai|spawn.*zai|zai runner|memory-domain|make-invoke-fn\\\\…\"}\n{:kind :cust