rematurely.\n\nDocumentation is updated in:\n\n- [M-shared-memory-control-build-test.md](/home/joe/code/futon3c/holes/missions/M-shared-memory-control-build-test.md)\n- [M-typed-memories.md](/home/joe/code/futon3c/holes/missions/M-typed-memories.md)\n- [CODEX-HANDOFF-p0-memory-record.md](/home/joe/code/futon3c/holes/CODEX-HANDOFF-p0-memory-record.md)\n\nFinal gates:\n\n- Futon3c: 22 tests, 292 assertions, green\n- Futon2 contract: 5 tests, 25 assertions, green\n- Lean trial: green\n- Parentheses and whitespace: clean\n- Lint: zero errors; three existing redundant-let warnings\n- Agency and futon1b health: good\n\nThe Agency JVM was hot-loaded, not restarted. `zai-6` remains registered. No commits were created.\n\nTOOL DIGEST\n{:kind :function_call, :name \"update_plan\", :call-id \"call_UbY9XSg6p76fvxRYvgEwIB1K\", :args \"{\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Resuming after surface timeout. Implementation, deployment, and live acceptance are complete; final gates and evidence handoff remain.\\\",\\\"plan\\\":[{\\\"step\\\":\\\"Inspect Phase 2 contract, repos…\"}\n{:kind :function_call_output, :call-id \"call_UbY9XSg6p76fvxRYvgEwIB1K\", :output \"Plan updated\"}\n{:kind :function_call, :name \"exec_command\", :call-id \"call_IyShaHBXG8TvpsuhKshiCM0m\", :args \"{\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"clojure -M:test -n futon3c.peripheral.memory-recall-test -n futon3c.peripheral.memory-write-test -n futon3c.peripheral.pattern-memory-phase2-test\\\\nclj-kondo --lint src/futon3c/peripheral/real_…\"}\n{:kind :function_call_output, :call-id \"call_IyShaHBXG8TvpsuhKshiCM0m\", :output \"Chunk ID: 5e85b1 Wall time: 24.7006 seconds Process exited with code 0 Original token count: 1348 Output: WARNING: Unknown module: org.apache.arrow.memory.core specified to --add-opens Running tests i…\"}\n{:kind :function_call, :name \"exec_command\", :call-id \"call_RLvdv4yWdgySKkOa5Ei7znnv\", :args \"{\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"clojure -X:test :nses '[futon2.aif.memory-contract-test]'\\\\nclj-kondo --lint src/futon2/aif/memory_contract