e everywhere.\\n  -- For now, we leave the construction as sorry — the key mathematical content (odd coefficients\\n  -- vanish) is proven above.\\n  sorry\", :old_string \"  sorry\", :path \"/home/joe/code/apm-lean/problems/a96J10/lean/Main.lean\"}", :result {:sha256-16 "74efebfb9d177286", :chars 103, :preview "{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"file\":\"/home/joe/code/apm-lean/problems/a96J10/lean/Main.lean\",\"replacements\":1}}"}}]}, :session-id "zai-5ae87545cd52472fb242b7a8f359fff5", :tags [:transcript :turn-round], :at "2026-07-13T12:54:03.188325704Z", :type :coordination, :subject #:ref{:type :agent, :id "zai-14"}, :author "zai-14", :claim-type :step, :id "e-fb547f48-20bb-4f1a-9594-de81dc10ff91"}} {:score -12.281881955358015, :entry #:evidence{:body {:session-uuid "019fa2c1-cd5a-73c0-abe5-82a329a2ef2e", :turn-id "019fb512-5683-7250-a994-4e67d44bda05", :event-seq-range [7031 7150], :reasoning-encrypted-only-count 2, :tool-digest-count 51, :rollout-file "/home/joe/.codex/sessions/2026/07/27/rollout-2026-07-27T09-47-17-019fa2c1-cd5a-73c0-abe5-82a329a2ef2e.jsonl", :turn 43, :event :turn-round, :truncated? true, :message-count 6, :harvester-version 1, :reasoning-count 18, :profile :codex-rollout, :original-text-bytes 17333, :text "Codex rollout turn 43\n\nREASONING (plaintext available in rollout)\n**Analyzing measurability impact on Bochner integral**\n\n**Inspecting Laplace and Mellin implementations**\n\n**Planning kernel construction for MemLp q**\n\n**Planning theorem for complex MGF**\n\n**Investigating Memℒp namespace notation**\n\n**Verifying target initial compilation**\n\n**Planning minimal scratch build environment**\n\n**Testing build command for Scratch.lean**\n\n**Resolving invalid Lean identifiers**\n**Correcting Mathlib API and imports**\n\n**Refining target semantics and lemmas**\n**Implementing compatibility patch and notations**\n\n\n\n**Identifying IsCompact global type issue**\n\n**Planning kernel proof with HolderTriple instance**\n\n**Searching for 