   106	  "Choose one of :retrieve/:act/:ask/:yield from already-built beliefs.
   107	
   108	   Input shape is intentionally plain data:
   109	     {:task-belief {:act-value ...}
   110	      :c-belief {:operator-c-uncertainty ...}
   111	      :gamma {mission {:policy-precision ...}} ; or scalar cells
   112	      :mission \"M-...\"
