   114	                     :estimated-tokens n}
   115	      :constants-override {:operator-attention-cost 0.15, ...}}
   116	
   117	   Higher v0 G term wins. Asymmetric admissibility is upstream: callers pass
   118	   only beliefs/actions that are allowed to be considered.
   119	
   120	   When :constants-override is supplied, its entries replace the
   121	   corresponding defaults in `constants` — this is how Z3a's dual-constant
   122	   paired comparison runs the same pure kernel under two costs without
   123	   duplicating the arithmetic (the shared-kernel discipline)."
   124	  [{:keys [task-belief c-belief gamma mission observations constants-override]}]
