 precedent, for Joe review); NO live weight moves without a J-gate -- no silent tuning, ever. CONVERGENCE, name it in the design: the retrospective ledger IS the precedent data arm C (:cascade-catalog-playout, U33 registry entry) wants to consume, and the upheld/refuted stream is a claimed-vs-verified verdict stream in R14 tau's own vocabulary."
