worklist.edn:241:   :design "2026-09-03 ~11:05: runs/U11-actand-design-v1.md DRAFTED (claude-2, futon2 d398625) from the reviewed U11a reading map. Belled to claude-1 for the joint-pass review (job invoke-1788432100206-7627-d21c65d2, parked park-9d1049d4). Registry :choices entry proposed verbatim in doc section 3, :status :open (choice-set registration, not a ruling); landing it is claude-1-side. Build sequence U11b-f defined, dispatch after review. NOTE: c427a68 is mislabeled -- it actually swept the loop's uncommitted unblock edit + reviewer's evidence restatement; THIS commit carries the design note its message promised. REVIEWED 2026-09-03 ~10:50 (claude-1, invoke-1788432100206): PASS with conditions -- A1 shared q-actand-record schema+validator (contract identity, added to U11b acceptance), A2a ordering probe + A2b counted digest stability (restored riders, section 6), A3 composition-seam forward-pointer (section 8). Amendments applied: futon2 53fa644. Registry entry lands via wm U33 (claude-1 confirms; substantive edits come back first). U11b-f proceed under claude-2 review alone unless the shared-schema work surprises. U11b LANDED+REVIEWED 2026-09-03 ~11:35: futon3c c686ca27 (codex-18) + 3874ada4 (claude-2 review fix). Review: pin RECOMPUTED from the real file (28 sessions in {:route :gamma :correction-label true} x :ask -> 18/10, densities 9/14 5/14 exact, cited id in group); A1 shared-contract test present with :mission exemplar + citation instruction; zero-support/provenance/determinism/missing-input all tested; gates reproduced 6/11 green, kondo 0/0, parens OK. FINDING FIXED BY REVIEWER: the route->arm warrant mapping was authored but read as derived -- now explicitly DECLARED per design section 4, revisable at U11e. U11f DISPATCHED (pulled ahead of c/d/e per Joe core-path ruling): job invoke-1788435096344-7638-267260cf, parked park-d5b969ba -- outcome is either the nonzero demo or the located wiring absence, both valid. U11f FIRST RUN STOPPED (correctly