;; live path doesn't speak stays green while meaning something false (the U8
;; gate's overbroad finding firing on a typed absence; mission_c_test's long-0
;; Bernoulli pin that live all-doubles observations can never produce). So
;; every test packet on this board requires at least one pin whose values are
;; CAPTURED FROM A LIVE RECORD (quoted verbatim, id cited) rather than
;; authored constants. D11's negative tests -- real false-positive prose,
;; verbatim -- are the reference pattern.
;;
