;; sites are X" must state the search command and whether its output was
;; truncated. A head-limited grep presented as an enumeration is the live-pin
;; class again: the tool spoke a truncated vocabulary, the text stayed
;; confident.
;;
;; The prejudice discipline, stated once: the mission wins
;; selection through DECLARED inputs (an operator-authored priority mark, a
;; mission doc the scan can read) — never by editing a rank or a weight by hand.
;; If the recovered selector cannot be moved by declared inputs, that is a
;; finding about the selector, not a license to cheat it.
