ue and provable statically, which is stronger than a query over a growing store: zai_api.clj:1169 passes the hydrator output as :inputs, zaif_controller.clj:205 stores it verbatim as :inputs-snapshot, and zaif_inputs.clj:246-252 returns a closed seven-key map whose :observations is {:posting-stats ...} alone. I wrote that basis into the map at :39-48 and restated the evidence line ranges it shifted. No live JVM was touched (:7070/:6768 untouched, no reload, no :7073 query -- the 56-decision numbers were read from the committed receipts rather than re-queried). No tests were added, so the live-record-pin and untracked-SKIP test rules do not bind; the discovery pins are real record ids as the acceptance asks. worklist_check passed after the edit."
