holes/labs/zaif-harness/worklist.edn:274:   :acceptance-live "2026-09-03 06:30Z (claude-2, lane owner): transport.http reloaded from master (D14+D15); the identical cold-thread Drawbridge persist that threw direct-buffer exhaustion at ~06:05 now succeeds; D14 seven-day drop ran live on the same update (7,615 -> 5,453 jobs, 5,292 tombstones, file 14,849,213 -> 11,560,029 bytes). JVM restart downgraded from recommended to optional-at-next-pause (frees ~4.29GB of pinned native memory; no longer blocks anything). Reviewer 06:21 2,089-byte file stat: unconfirmed -- no matching file found, no supported mechanism, ledger seq-consistent throughout; recorded as observation, not defect."}
