+   :evidence "futon3c 9215b4d2: test/futon3c/agents/zaif_actand_test.clj:104-131 derives a nonempty U11 belief from tracked calibration record e-0cae94f2-9ca8-4863-9251-44278445a5f7, persists it as EDN after turn one, reconstructs it through the production hydrator/controller for turn two, and pins unchanged provenance plus act term 0.2513144282809061. futon2 (this commit): runs/U10-node-coverage.edn:17 marks R1 covered and points to the test. Gates: clj-kondo 0 errors/0 warnings; check-parens exit 0; futon3c.agents.zaif-actand-test 8 tests/27 assertions green."}
