our candidate fields VERIFIED present in the real R2 fixture by reviewer (mission-health/loop-health/support-coverage/attack-coverage), :phase-progress verified absent; adapter uses the PUBLIC select-mission-action evaluator, :action/:tau required undefaulted; live pin = tracked 801976e7-R2 verbatim values; refusal count measured 3/3 frequencies-asserted; exact-scalar test 0.75 via deterministic lookup. Gates reproduced 8/22, kondo 0/0, parens OK. U11e (comparison runner) next -- the last adapter-lane packet. U11e LANDED+REVIEWED 2026-09-03 ~12:00: futon3c c7bd2e24 + futon2 b8fd001 (codex-18), PASS. HEADLINE: calibration-table-a4 = 3 distinct values over 114 sessions (vs both baselines at 1); A/B/C = 0 produced (all typed refusals -- the honest absence the adapters declared); mission fixtures: all columns 0. Reviewer RECOMPUTED the groups from the raw file: 0.2513 (gamma 28), -1.0857 (non-correction 77), -Inf shared by c-channel 0/8 and actand 0/1 (9 sessions) -- distinct 3 CONFIRMED. -Inf cannot reach the live controller (D8b finite-number? gate verified); design A4-addendum records the zero-support decision as riding the arm ruling. Ordering probes pass all applicable columns with cited fields/directions; digest stability 0/612; committed artifact = fresh recompute (tested). Gates reproduced 5/14, kondo 0/0, parens OK. ADAPTER LANE COMPLETE (b/c/d/e/f). Awaiting: loop node rows, wm U32, J-ruling on the arm + flip. NODE ROWS COMPLETE 2026-09-03 12:01: the loop signed all eight (U16z-U23z; U22z via one full review-FAIL/repair/re-review cycle, U23z with a reviewer-added divergent-pair strengthening -- spot-checked by lane owner, 24/112 green at 1b294a74). Per-node flip gate now green for 10/13 R nodes; R1/R3/R4 (U24z-U26z) unblock when THIS row signs. U11 ACCEPTANCE STATE: design reviewed [x], named query + table [x U11b], comparison with discrimination headline vs named baselines [x U11e: 3 distinct vs 1], provenance query through D8b seam [x], live-shaped nonzero d