/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/worklist.edn:246:   :statement "Rung 3 of the zero-support ladder (J-ruling + design [A5]): the typed refusal MINTS a tension record. When rung-2 pooling still yields zero support for the target, the refusal (a) stays a typed q-actand refusal beneath the D8b finite gate, and (b) appends a tension record to the wm U41 ledger -- SCHEMA IS THEIRS, CROSS-CITE, DO NOT FORK: holes/labs/wm-contract/DESIGN-tensions-as-patterns.md section 3, appended via the u41_tension_ledger.bb shape into tension-ledger.edn (or its API if one exists by build time -- check with a grep, state what you found), with :born-of :refused-prediction and the refusal (grain, actand, action, the empty kin pool) as the record body. First live case: actand x :retrieve from U27z. NOTE: writing to the wm-contract ledger file is a cross-board write -- the row is done only with a claude-1-side acknowledgment (bell claude-2 who relays, or their reviewer signs the ledger commit); if the ledger write cannot be made additive-and-attributed, STOP and report instead."
