/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/labs/zaif-harness/runs/build-loop.log:91251:241-   :review "Reviewed 2026-09-03 (review seat; the design/build lane was claude-2 + codex-18 with claude-1 reviewing the design, so author != reviewer). (1) futon2 status clean except untracked build-loop.lock/.log; all 12 evidence shas read; every futon3c commit path-scoped to src/futon3c/agents/zaif_{actand,arm_adapters,arm_comparison}.clj plus its test file, every futon2 commit to the design doc or the artifact alone; author date == commit date on all 12, so no --amend. (2) GATES RE-RUN in an isolated sibling worktree at c7bd2e24 (futon3c-review-loop, removed after; no live JVM touched): the three namespaces gave 'Ran 20 tests containing 56 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors' with exit 0 captured directly; clj-kondo 0 errors 0 warnings; futon4/dev/check-parens.el OK. (3) HEADLINE RECOMPUTED from the tracked calibration file independently of the code: 114 sessions in four (actand, arm) groups -- (gamma,true)->:ask n=28 gold=18, density 9/14 and 5/14, act 0.2513144282809061; (nil,false)->:act n=77 gold=13, act -1.085708883832202; (c-channel,true)->:ask n=8 gold=0 and (actand,true)->:retrieve n=1 gold=0, both -Inf; 28+77+8+1=114. DISTINCT 3 against both named baselines at 1 -- the headline holds. The pinned demo value is ln(9/14)-ln(1/2) and equals 0.2513144282809061 exactly, matching the test assertion and the artifact. (4) ARTIFACT FRESHNESS ESTABLISHED rather than assumed: re-ran comparison-report over the tracked corpora in the review worktree and diffed against the committed runs/U11e-comparison-v1.edn -- IDENTICAL. (Worth noting for later: no test and no regenerate script tie the file to the runner, and the artifact carries no :replay-command, unlike D9's; I checked it by hand this time.) Rider numbers recomputed too: arm-A probe 0.14/0.56 from policy.clj:54-63, arm-B 0.8/0.2 from mission_head.clj:139, calibration plants ln(6/7)=-0.15415067982725827 and ln(12/7)=0.5389965007326869; digest